[ceiling] Required flex-clearance bridge at the approved upper wing root. Each 1.9 mm X opening runs along the full Y span and ends at Z186.195, defining the 21 mm lower flexible section after filling the upper gap. The current retainer native slice emits the entire part with no support; pump-snap-review/print-review.json binds that archive. This is a deliberate spring clearance, not an unintended enclosed roof.
alternatives: Filling this remaining clearance joins the lower wing to the rigid carrier and prevents its inward travel. Moving its roof changes the approved flexible length. Splitting the span or adding separate access cuts introduces the unnecessary end edges Derek removed.
