[thin] Required 2.4 mm nominal spring walls in the approved full-Y pump snap. The sampled 2.395 mm mesh result lies on those continuous curved walls; it is not a residual fin or an unrequested thinning pocket. The 21 mm lower wing supplies the required inward hook travel. The complete wings, hooks and upper roots have local 100% infill in the bound native print projects; retention and lifetime remain unmeasured.
alternatives: A thicker wall changes spring stiffness and available bending travel; filling the clearance makes the snap rigid. Shortening the Y span restores the extra end edges Derek explicitly removed.
